---
import InteractivePortrait from "~/pages/_components/InteractivePortrait.astro";
---

<section class="wrapper mesh">
  <h2 class="sr-only">About me</h2>
  <div class="mesh-center pb-4">
    <InteractivePortrait />
    <p class="font-reading">I'm Kristof, software engineer with a backend-leaning full stack profile. Most of my work lives on the server side, but I'm just as happy shaping the frontend or a native app when a product needs clarity, polish, or a better user or developer experience.</p>
    <p class="font-reading">Over the years I've worked across government, telecom, finance, mobility, and internal product teams, building everything from microservices and event-driven systems to modern frontends. I like software that's practical, well-structured, and a little bit opinionated.</p>
    <p class="font-reading">Outside client work, I tend to disappear into technical rabbit holes: operating systems, developer tooling, awkward platform quirks, and the kind of bugs that turn into a good story afterwards.</p>
  </div>
</section>
